WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:03.530
How did you do in your time of
prayer, in your time of thinking

2
00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:05.530
about it prayer? Don't you like
it when I do that and just take

3
00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:08.730
something complex, just make
it sound a lot more simple?

4
00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:10.810
Cause that's what
it should be, right?

5
00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:16.020
Too much of the
trappings of religion.

6
00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:19.540
And they can just create weight.

7
00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:22.740
And they can create
space from God.

8
00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:26.820
And I'm not putting anything
on any particular religion or

9
00:00:26.870 --> 00:00:29.860
religious system. I'm not
trying to do any of that.

10
00:00:29.910 --> 00:00:34.100
I'm just saying that sometimes
man makes it harder to get closer

11
00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:36.660
to God. And God's like, man,
you don't have to work, you don't

12
00:00:36.710 --> 00:00:37.620
have to work that hard.

13
00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:42.180
In fact, it's not about working
hard, it's about spending

14
00:00:42.230 --> 00:00:43.060
time

15
00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:48.210
with the King. And it's funny how
we get into these seasons, like

16
00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:51.490
this season right now that
we're in, and we sense that.

17
00:00:51.540 --> 00:00:53.810
We sense that somehow
God is closer.

18
00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:56.930
Like we're moving to this climactic
moment tomorrow where it's

19
00:00:56.980 --> 00:00:58.690
like all coming together, right?

20
00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:01.840
And you're just like, man,
I can't wait for that.

21
00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:05.910
Neither can I. So do me a favor.

22
00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:08.340
Take that feeling

23
00:01:09.590 --> 00:01:13.170
and try to bring it into
every day of your life.

24
00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:19.190
And then you're gonna find
that the weight of just

25
00:01:19.240 --> 00:01:23.750
feeling disconnected,
or like it's all difficult,

26
00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:25.270
or how do I get closer to God?

27
00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:27.030
How do I make sure I
check all these boxes?

28
00:01:27.080 --> 00:01:28.370
How do I make sure you do it?

29
00:01:31.990 --> 00:01:33.700
It's not about checking boxes.

30
00:01:33.750 --> 00:01:36.400
It's about spending
time with the Lord.

31
00:01:37.380 --> 00:01:38.450
Jesus, we love you.

32
00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:39.810
We're so grateful for you, Lord.

33
00:01:39.860 --> 00:01:41.090
We're grateful for this day.

34
00:01:41.140 --> 00:01:45.330
We're celebrating, Lord,
Immanuel, God with us.

35
00:01:45.380 --> 00:01:49.570
We're celebrating the expectation
of what's coming tomorrow,

36
00:01:49.620 --> 00:01:52.210
Lord. And so we're
sitting with you today.

37
00:01:53.110 --> 00:01:56.500
And Lord, I'm asking that will
we take the same feeling of

38
00:01:56.550 --> 00:01:57.810
anticipation

39
00:01:59.030 --> 00:02:01.220
when it comes to you, Lord, and
will we bring that same feeling

40
00:02:01.270 --> 00:02:04.740
of spiritual anticipation
with us into every day?

41
00:02:04.790 --> 00:02:05.974
In Jesus' name, amen.

